<p>Allahu akbar, allahu akbar.. hussain hussain hussain..(2)<br> ba waqt asr karbala, raazi ba zuljanah(2)..(2)<br> pusht e zuljanah pe (fateh khaibar ka laal)..(2)<br> aayi sada e ghaib, zehra ke noore ayn<br> shehenshah e mashraqain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Marhaba, marhaba...<br> shahe karbobala<br> aagaye hai ali<br> aur rasool e khuda<br> apni sawari rann ko badhao<br> tegh uthao ya hussain<br> fatah e lashkar, ho ibn e haider<br> sabko batao ya hussain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Teghe yadullahi<br> hai shuja e arab<br> deene Mohammad ki<br> tu baqa ka sabab<br> shane imamat, shane qayadat<br> teri wirasat ya hussain<br> ye fauje aada, yaad karegi<br> teri shuja'at ya hussain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Jab ke tera faras<br> rann ki janib chala<br> jaan bachane laga<br> lashkare ashqiya<br> rann ko ulatkar, maida'n palatkar<br> tune dikhaya ya hussain<br> khandaq o khaibar, badr ka manzar<br> yaad dilaya ya hussain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Tegh teri chali<br> hashr barpa hua<br> ek hone laga<br> maimana maisara<br> tegho pe teghe, dhalo pe dhaale<br> lasho pe laashe yaa hussain<br> sehmi hui thi, bikhri hui thi<br> faujo ki saansein yaa hussain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Shaah ladte rahe<br> shaah ladte rahe<br> jung ko dekhne<br> ambiya aagaye<br> pyaas ke aalam, mein ye ladai<br> tera jigar hai yaa hussain<br> tune bataya, ke shere dawar<br> ka tu pisar hai yaa hussain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Daf'atan ruk gaye<br> daste shahe huda<br> aayi aflaak se<br> irja'ee ki sadaa<br> rabb tera tujhse, raazi hua hai<br> aao palat kar yaa hussain<br> sajda e akhir, ka waqt hai ye<br> mehbub e daawar yaa hussain<br> bismillah husssain....</p> 
<p>Teer chalte the kahi se kahi naize hai chale<br> pusht e rahwaar se shabbir sare farsh gire<br> darr se khaime ke bahen dekh rahi thi dukhiya<br> aur sakina ki sadaa thi mere baba, baba<br> hashr barpa hua salman o raza<br> aayi jab fatima zehra ki sadaa<br> haye pyaasa hussain, hussain<br> haye pyaasa hussain, hussain<br> zakhmi zee'n zakhmi sarr<br> khaak par tera sarr<br> haye pyaasa hussain, hussain<br> haye pyaasa hussain, hussain</p>